        <h1 class="fade-up fade-up-2">Parachute</h1>
        <p class="tagline fade-up fade-up-3">A self-hostable ecosystem for your knowledge</p>
        <p class="subtitle fade-up fade-up-4">Open source &middot; Built on <a href="https://modelcontextprotocol.io" target="_blank">MCP</a> &middot; Available now</p>

        <div class="hero-install fade-up fade-up-5">
            <div class="code-inline">
                <code>bun add -g @openparachute/cli &amp;&amp; parachute install vault</code>
            </div>
